flowchart TD
    REQ[/User: feature request/] --> MODE{Argument shape?}
    MODE -->|prose| AUTH[Authoring mode]
    MODE -->|readable file or issue URL| VAL[Validate mode: critique a document we did not write]
    MODE -->|path-like but unresolved| REFUSE[/Refuse: name the unresolved path/]

    AUTH --> SCOPE{Bundles unrelated features?}
    SCOPE -->|yes| SPLIT[/User approves a split: one spec per feature/]
    SPLIT --> LOOP
    SCOPE -->|no| LOOP

    subgraph SPECS ["/specs: three artifacts, one loop each"]
        LOOP[User drafts artifact] --> CRIT[Agent critiques: gap, ambiguity, conflict, scope]
        CRIT --> DECIDE[/User decides: accept, reject, modify/]
        DECIDE --> REFINE[Agent refines, preserving user language]
        REFINE --> STABLE{Stable within 2 iterations?}
        STABLE -->|no| ESC[Escalate to Orchestrator]
        STABLE -->|yes| ARP
        ARP[Ambiguity Resolution Protocol: infer, predictability check, classify] --> CLASS{Classification}
        CLASS -->|inferable| LOG[Log inference and rationale]
        CLASS -->|requires-stakeholder-input| ASK[/Batch of N questions to the user/]
        ASK --> LOG
        LOG --> SWEEP[Completeness sweep: CRUD, auth, audit, errors]
        SWEEP --> GATE{Cross-artifact consistency gate}
        GATE -->|fail| LOOP
    end
    VAL --> CRIT

    GATE -->|pass| PERSIST[Persist spec: docs/specs file or GitHub epic issue]
    PERSIST --> WHICH{Mode?}
    WHICH -->|validate| OFFER[/Offer /plan, never auto-invoke/]
    WHICH -->|authoring| NEXT[/Auto-invoke /plan/]
